@SupportTicket.Api_HostAddress = http://localhost:5000

### Health
GET {{SupportTicket.Api_HostAddress}}/api/health
Accept: application/json

### List tickets
GET {{SupportTicket.Api_HostAddress}}/api/tickets
Accept: application/json

### List tickets with search and status filter
GET {{SupportTicket.Api_HostAddress}}/api/tickets?search=login&status=Open
Accept: application/json

### Get ticket detail
GET {{SupportTicket.Api_HostAddress}}/api/tickets/1
Accept: application/json

### Create ticket
POST {{SupportTicket.Api_HostAddress}}/api/tickets
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Test ticket",
  "description": "Created from .http file",
  "priority": "Medium",
  "assignedTo": null,
  "createdBy": 4
}

### Update ticket status
PATCH {{SupportTicket.Api_HostAddress}}/api/tickets/1/status
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "In Progress"
}

### List users (for dropdowns)
GET {{SupportTicket.Api_HostAddress}}/api/tickets/users
Accept: application/json
